#: WhatsNext.gpr.py:52
msgid "What's Next"
msgstr "Que vén agora"

#: WhatsNext.gpr.py:53
msgid "Gramplet suggesting items to research"
msgstr "Gramplet que suxire elementos para investigar"

#: WhatsNext.gpr.py:66
msgid "What's Next?"
msgstr "Que vén agora?"

#: WhatsNext.py:129
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Axuda"

#: WhatsNext.py:206
msgid "People"
msgstr "Persoas"

#: WhatsNext.py:210
msgid "Unknown first name"
msgstr "Nome descoñecido"

#: WhatsNext.py:211
msgid "Report a person without a first name"
msgstr "Informar dunha persoa sen nome"

#: WhatsNext.py:213
msgid "Unknown surname"
msgstr "Apelido descoñecido"

#: WhatsNext.py:213
msgid "Report a person without a surname"
msgstr "Informar dunha persoa sen apelido"

#: WhatsNext.py:216
msgid "Missing Birth event"
msgstr "Falta o evento Nacemento"

#: WhatsNext.py:217
msgid "Report a person without a Birth event"
msgstr "Informar dunha persoa sen evento Nacemento"

#: WhatsNext.py:221
msgid "Birth date and place"
msgstr "Data e lugar de nacemento"

#: WhatsNext.py:222
msgid "Check the date and place of the Birth event"
msgstr "Comprobar a data e o lugar do evento Nacemento"

#: WhatsNext.py:226
msgid "Missing Death event"
msgstr "Falta o evento Defunción"

#: WhatsNext.py:228
msgid ""
"Report a person without a Death event, when Gramps judges from the dates of "
"the person and relatives that the person is no longer alive"
msgstr ""
"Informar dunha persoa sen evento Defunción, cando Gramps deduce polas datas "
"da persoa e dos seus parentes que a persoa xa non vive"

#: WhatsNext.py:235
msgid "Death date and place"
msgstr "Data e lugar de defunción"

#: WhatsNext.py:236
msgid "Check the date and place of the Death event"
msgstr "Comprobar a data e o lugar do evento Defunción"

#: WhatsNext.py:241
msgid "Families"
msgstr "Familias"

#: WhatsNext.py:245
msgid "Unknown relationship type"
msgstr "Tipo de relación descoñecido"

#: WhatsNext.py:246
msgid "Report a family with the relationship type \"Unknown\""
msgstr "Informar dunha familia co tipo de relación \"Descoñecido\""

#: WhatsNext.py:250
msgid "Missing Marriage event"
msgstr "Falta o evento Matrimonio"

#: WhatsNext.py:251
msgid "Report a family of the \"Married\" type without a Marriage event"
msgstr "Informar dunha familia do tipo \"Casados\" sen evento Matrimonio"

#: WhatsNext.py:255
msgid "Marriage date and place"
msgstr "Data e lugar do matrimonio"

#: WhatsNext.py:256
msgid "Check the date and place of the Marriage event"
msgstr "Comprobar a data e o lugar do evento Matrimonio"

#: WhatsNext.py:260
msgid "Divorce date and place"
msgstr "Data e lugar do divorcio"

#: WhatsNext.py:261
msgid "Check the date and place of the Divorce event"
msgstr "Comprobar a data e o lugar do evento Divorcio"

#: WhatsNext.py:266
msgid "Relationships"
msgstr "Relacións"

#: WhatsNext.py:270
msgid "Missing parent family"
msgstr "Falta a familia dos pais"

#: WhatsNext.py:271
msgid "List each person who has no parent family"
msgstr "Listar cada persoa que non ten familia dos pais"

#: WhatsNext.py:275
msgid "Missing partner"
msgstr "Falta a parella"

#: WhatsNext.py:276
msgid "Report a family with only one partner"
msgstr "Informar dunha familia cun só membro da parella"

#: WhatsNext.py:280
msgid "Missing father"
msgstr "Falta o pai"

#: WhatsNext.py:281
msgid "Report a person whose parent family has no father"
msgstr "Informar dunha persoa cuxa familia dos pais non ten pai"

#: WhatsNext.py:285
msgid "Missing mother"
msgstr "Falta a nai"

#: WhatsNext.py:286
msgid "Report a person whose parent family has no mother"
msgstr "Informar dunha persoa cuxa familia dos pais non ten nai"

#: WhatsNext.py:291
msgid "Events"
msgstr "Eventos"

#: WhatsNext.py:293
msgid "Unknown date"
msgstr "Data descoñecida"

#: WhatsNext.py:293
msgid "Report an event without a date"
msgstr "Informar dun evento sen data"

#: WhatsNext.py:296
msgid "Date is text only"
msgstr "A data só é texto"

#: WhatsNext.py:297
msgid "Report a date that Gramps could not read as a date"
msgstr "Informar dunha data que Gramps non puido ler como data"

#: WhatsNext.py:301
msgid "Inexact date"
msgstr "Data inexacta"

#: WhatsNext.py:303
msgid ""
"Report a range, a span, or a date with \"before\", \"after\", \"about\", "
"\"estimated\" or \"calculated\""
msgstr ""
"Informar dun intervalo, un período ou unha data con \"antes de\", \"despois "
"de\", \"arredor de\", \"estimada\" ou \"calculada\""

#: WhatsNext.py:309
msgid "Incomplete date"
msgstr "Data incompleta"

#: WhatsNext.py:310
msgid "Report a single date without its day or month"
msgstr "Informar dunha data simple sen día ou mes"

#: WhatsNext.py:312
msgid "Unknown place"
msgstr "Lugar descoñecido"

#: WhatsNext.py:312
msgid "Report an event without a place"
msgstr "Informar dun evento sen lugar"

#: WhatsNext.py:330
msgid "Enter the missing name in the Edit Person dialog."
msgstr "Introduza o nome que falta no diálogo Editar persoa."

#: WhatsNext.py:331
msgid "Add via the Events tab of the Edit Person dialog."
msgstr "Engádao desde a lapela Eventos do diálogo Editar persoa."

#: WhatsNext.py:333
msgid ""
"Open the event on the Events tab of the Edit Person dialog, and complete its"
" date and place."
msgstr ""
"Abra o evento na lapela Eventos do diálogo Editar persoa e complete a súa "
"data e lugar."

#: WhatsNext.py:337
msgid ""
"Open the event on the Events tab of the Edit Family dialog, and complete its"
" date and place."
msgstr ""
"Abra o evento na lapela Eventos do diálogo Editar familia e complete a súa "
"data e lugar."

#: WhatsNext.py:340
msgid "Add a Marriage event on the Events tab of the Edit Family dialog."
msgstr ""
"Engada un evento Matrimonio na lapela Eventos do diálogo Editar familia."

#: WhatsNext.py:341
msgid "Choose the relationship \"Type\" in the Edit Family dialog."
msgstr "Escolla o \"Tipo\" de relación no diálogo Editar familia."

#: WhatsNext.py:342
msgid "Add the missing partner in the Edit Family dialog."
msgstr "Engada a parella que falta no diálogo Editar familia."

#: WhatsNext.py:343
msgid "Add the father in the Edit Family dialog of the parent family."
msgstr "Engada o pai no diálogo Editar familia da familia dos pais."

#: WhatsNext.py:344
msgid "Add the mother in the Edit Family dialog of the parent family."
msgstr "Engada a nai no diálogo Editar familia da familia dos pais."

#: WhatsNext.py:346
msgid ""
"In the Relationships view, choose \"Add New Parents...\" or \"Add Existing "
"Parents...\" from the Edit menu."
msgstr ""
"Na vista Relacións, escolla \"Engadir novos pais...\" ou \"Engadir pais "
"existentes...\" no menú Editar."

#: WhatsNext.py:400
msgid "Completed"
msgstr "Completado"

#: WhatsNext.py:402
msgid "Ignored"
msgstr "Ignorado"

#: WhatsNext.py:404
msgid "Pruned"
msgstr "Podado"

#: WhatsNext.py:546
msgid ""
"\n"
" ⛔ A local Genealogical Tree database has not yet been loaded.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" ⛔ Aínda non se cargou ningunha base de datos local de árbore xenealóxica.\n"
"\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:548
msgid " 👣 Next Steps:\n"
msgstr " 👣 Seguintes pasos:\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:549
msgid "  •  From the \"Family Trees\" menu,"
msgstr "  •  No menú \"Árbores xenealóxicas\","

#: WhatsNext.py:550
msgid " use the \"Manage Family Trees...\" option to"
msgstr " use a opción \"Xestionar árbores xenealóxicas...\" para"

#: WhatsNext.py:551
msgid " create a New (or to select an existing) Tree database.\n"
msgstr ""
" crear unha nova base de datos de árbore (ou para seleccionar unha "
"existente).\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:552
msgid "  •  Click the \"Load Family Tree\" button to begin"
msgstr "  •  Prema o botón \"Cargar árbore xenealóxica\" para comezar"

#: WhatsNext.py:553
msgid ""
" working with the selected genealogical tree.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" a traballar coa árbore xenealóxica seleccionada.\n"
"\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:556
msgid ""
"To use a backup from Gramps, or a GEDCOM file from another genealogical tool, choose \"Import...\" in the \"Family Trees\" menu.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Para usar unha copia de seguridade de Gramps, ou un ficheiro GEDCOM doutra ferramenta xenealóxica, escolla \"Importar...\" no menú \"Árbores xenealóxicas\".\n"
"\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:562
msgid ""
"To use a backup from Gramps, or a GEDCOM file from another genealogical tool, first create and load a new, empty tree. Then choose \"Import...\" in the \"Family Trees\" menu.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Para usar unha copia de seguridade de Gramps, ou un ficheiro GEDCOM doutra ferramenta xenealóxica, primeiro cree e cargue unha árbore nova e baleira. Despois escolla \"Importar...\" no menú \"Árbores xenealóxicas\".\n"
"\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:622
msgid "Use the \"Configure\" in the \"View\" menu to change the Gramplet options."
msgstr "Use \"Configurar...\" no menú \"Ver\" para cambiar as opcións do gramplet."

#: WhatsNext.py:680 WhatsNext.py:1297
msgid "Organize Tags"
msgstr "Organizar etiquetas"

#: WhatsNext.py:719
msgid "Complete"
msgstr "Completar"

#: WhatsNext.py:720
msgid "Tag listed People and Families as Completed"
msgstr "Etiquetar as persoas e familias listadas como Completadas"

#: WhatsNext.py:729
msgid "Ignore"
msgstr "Ignorar"

#: WhatsNext.py:730
msgid "Tag to Ignore People and Families"
msgstr "Etiquetar para ignorar persoas e familias"

#: WhatsNext.py:739
msgid "Prune"
msgstr "Podar"

#: WhatsNext.py:741
msgid "Tag to Prune (exclude) listed People and Families from testing"
msgstr ""
"Etiquetar para podar (excluír) da comprobación as persoas e familias "
"listadas"

#: WhatsNext.py:820
msgid "Search Quota "
msgstr "Cota de busca "

#: WhatsNext.py:824
msgid ""
"The least number of lines to show. The search stops once this many problems "
"are found"
msgstr ""
"O número mínimo de liñas que amosar. A busca detense en canto se atopan "
"tantos problemas"

#: WhatsNext.py:832
msgid "Depth per loop"
msgstr "Profundidade por volta"

#: WhatsNext.py:836
msgid ""
"How many generations of descendants to check before going up one more "
"generation of ancestors"
msgstr ""
"Cantas xeracións de descendentes comprobar antes de subir unha xeración máis"
" de antepasados"

#: WhatsNext.py:844
msgid "Pause search expansion"
msgstr "Pausar a ampliación da busca"

#: WhatsNext.py:848
msgid ""
"How many extra rounds to wait after checking an ancestor before checking the"
" descendants of that ancestor"
msgstr ""
"Cantas voltas adicionais agardar despois de comprobar un antepasado antes de"
" comprobar os seus descendentes"

#: WhatsNext.py:856
msgid "Complete tag"
msgstr "Etiqueta de completado"

#: WhatsNext.py:857
msgid "Finished. Hide the object, and keep searching through it"
msgstr "Rematado. Agochar o obxecto e seguir buscando a través del"

#: WhatsNext.py:862
msgid "Ignore tag"
msgstr "Etiqueta de ignorado"

#: WhatsNext.py:864
msgid "Set aside for now. Hide the object, and keep searching through it"
msgstr ""
"Apartado polo momento. Agochar o obxecto e seguir buscando a través del"

#: WhatsNext.py:870
msgid "Prune tag"
msgstr "Etiqueta de podado"

#: WhatsNext.py:871
msgid "Dead end. Hide the object, and stop searching through it"
msgstr "Rúa sen saída. Agochar o obxecto e deixar de buscar a través del"

#: WhatsNext.py:888
msgid "Show suggested 👣 Next Steps"
msgstr "Amosar os 👣 seguintes pasos suxeridos"

#: WhatsNext.py:891
msgid ""
"Show the guidance steps and the 👣 suggestions. Turn off for a shorter list"
msgstr ""
"Amosar os pasos de orientación e as 👣 suxestións. Desactíveo para unha lista"
" máis curta"

#: WhatsNext.py:1277
msgid "_Review (open editor)"
msgstr "_Revisar (abrir o editor)"

#: WhatsNext.py:1287
msgid "Tag as Complete"
msgstr "Etiquetar como Completado"

#: WhatsNext.py:1288
msgid "Tag to Ignore"
msgstr "Etiquetar para ignorar"

#: WhatsNext.py:1289
msgid "Tag to Prune"
msgstr "Etiquetar para podar"

#: WhatsNext.py:1529
#, python-format
msgid "Tag as %s"
msgstr "Etiquetar como %s"

#: WhatsNext.py:1613
msgid ""
"\n"
" ⛔ The current Tree database contains no people.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" ⛔ A base de datos da árbore actual non contén persoas.\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:1616
msgid ""
"\n"
" 👣 Next Steps:\n"
" Add a Family and a person in that family:\n"
"  • A Family may be added via the \"Add\" menu\n"
"  • A person may be added by pressing the \"+\" (plus) in the spouse (\"Father/partner1\" or \"Mother/partner2\") panels or \"Children\" tab.\n"
"\n"
"Or Import People from an external file:\n"
"  • An external file may be used to populate the tree via \"Import...\" in the \"Family Trees\" menu."
msgstr ""
"\n"
" 👣 Seguintes pasos:\n"
" Engada unha familia e unha persoa nesa familia:\n"
"  • Pódese engadir unha familia mediante o menú \"Engadir\"\n"
"  • Pódese engadir unha persoa premendo \"+\" (máis) nos paneis da parella (\"Pai/parella1\" ou \"Nai/parella2\") ou na lapela \"Fillos\".\n"
"\n"
"Ou importe persoas dun ficheiro externo:\n"
"  • Pódese usar un ficheiro externo para encher a árbore mediante \"Importar...\" no menú \"Árbores xenealóxicas\"."

#: WhatsNext.py:1632
msgid ""
"\n"
" ⛔ No Person has been chosen as the focal \"Home Person\".\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" ⛔ Non se escolleu ningunha persoa como \"Persoa inicial\" central.\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:1635
msgid ""
"\n"
" 👣 Next Steps:\n"
"  •  Select the People view icon in the Navigator sidebar.\n"
"  •  Select someone to make them the \"Active Person\".\n"
"  •  Choose \"Set Home Person\" from the Edit menu or from the (right-click) context menu.\n"
"\n"
" This sets them as the focal \"Home Person\"."
msgstr ""
"\n"
" 👣 Seguintes pasos:\n"
"  •  Seleccione a icona da vista Persoas na barra lateral do Navegador.\n"
"  •  Seleccione alguén para facelo a \"Persoa activa\".\n"
"  •  Escolla \"Establecer persoa inicial\" no menú Editar ou no menú contextual (clic dereito).\n"
"\n"
" Así establécese como a \"Persoa inicial\" central."

#: WhatsNext.py:1645
msgid "Double-click color text to edit details"
msgstr "Faga dobre clic no texto en cor para editar os detalles"

#: WhatsNext.py:1664
msgid "focal Home Person"
msgstr "Persoa inicial central"

